confirm.description:
The {operation} stage in {room} was interrupted on {robot}. {reason}

Check the room and resolve the obstruction or error. Once the vacuum has safely docked, it can clean other eligible rooms while this Repair remains open.

Submitting this Repair allows the unfinished stage to retry through normal scheduling. Previously completed stages stay completed. Confirmation sends no cleaning command and does not override occupancy, cleaning windows, battery, or water checks.
